  <p style="margin-left:1.667%;text-indent:0;font-size:10pt;margin-top:0;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;margin-right:0.694%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:normal;font-size:10pt;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;min-width:fit-content;">  </font></p>
